<title>USA: Sears August same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Sears August same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sears, Roebuck and Co said Thursday its comparable domestic store revenues rose 4.4 percent for the four weeks ended August 31.</p>
<p>This compared with a three percent increase in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Total domestic store revenues for August were $2.06 billion, 7.6 percent above revenues of $1.91 billion for the four weeks ended September 2, 1995.</p>
</text>
